# HOME for the render browser.
#
# Chromium will not start without a writable home — and does not fail cleanly
# either: its crashpad handler cannot create its database, so the browser hangs
# until the renderer's startup budget expires. Mode 0700 because a rendered
# patient page passes through this process.
#
# Safe under the layout rule in carlos-emr.tmpfiles: /var/lib/carlos-emr is
# root-owned, so the transition into a directory owned by a different
# unprivileged user is one systemd-tmpfiles will make.
d /var/lib/carlos-emr/render 0700 carlos-render carlos-render -
